  <item>
    <title>vol67：老派追星女漫谈杰尼斯（上）：旧梦渐远、故人离散，只有年轻时追星才相信永恒吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a4d13df3fb7233cbf455233</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a4d13df3fb7233cbf455233</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 15:10:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听时间薯片，这是一档不定期更新的闲聊播客。</span></p><p><span>本期是四周年特别主题栏目上篇，小Q和小歪两个老派追星女回顾了我们追星的原生家庭杰尼斯。</span></p><p><span>我们从2018年主要团体变化开始聊起，涵盖了黄金一代前后的人员变化和公司制度的变迁。回顾时我们发现，时代的动荡和个人的成长也影响着我们追星的感受。虽然当时没有人知道那已经是终章的开端。</span></p><p><span>本期的讨论有浓重的个人情感色彩，也有“粉籍”，欢迎有不同想法的朋友们友好讨论。</span></p><p></p><p><span>以下是shownotes：</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>2018年新老交接</span></strong></p><h1><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">05:01</a> 泷泽秀明宣布退出演艺圈，转向幕后。</span></h1><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">7:35</a> 山口达也因丑闻事件退团退社，TOKIO此后成为4人体制。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">9:30</a> 涩谷昴宣布退出关8</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> King &amp; Prince六人正式出道。</span></p><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><h3><strong><span>2019年组合动荡</span></strong></h3><h3><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1063">17:43</a> 岚宣布活动休止计划</span></h3><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a></span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>二宫和也结婚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2053">34:13</a></span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>锦户亮退出关八并离开事务所</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">36:50</a> Johnny's Island成立，泷泽秀明担任社长管理Jr；喜多川去世</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr325ITTZksP-rvS7MoPDyf3-f_6.jpg"></figure><p></p><p><strong><span>2020年旧人停止新人登台</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2374">39:34</a> 岚休活前的无人国立演唱会</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2907">48:27</a> Snow Man与SixTONES同时出道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 手越祐也退出 NEWS 并离开事务所</span></p><p></p><h1><strong><span>2021年平成老团系统性退场</span></strong></h1><h1><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3291">54:51</a>长濑智也退社，余下三人成立株式会社TOKIO</span></h1><h1><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a> 岩桥玄树退出KP并离开事务所</span></h1><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3508">58:28</a> V6解散</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">1:00:00</a> なにわ男子正式出道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4437">1:13:57</a> 樱井翔和相叶雅纪结婚</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>2022年意料之外的出走</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4683">1:18:03</a> 泷泽秀明离开杰尼斯成立TOBE</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4771">1:19:31</a>King &amp; Prince平野紫耀、岸优太、神宫寺勇太宣布退团退社。后三人成立Number_i加入TOBE</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5374">1:29:34</a></span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>Marius叶在年底退出sexy zone</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5416">1:30:16</a> Travis Japan出道</span></p><p></p><p><span>本期BGM：</span></p><p><span>オモイダマ - 関ジャニ∞</span></p><p><span>シンデレラガール - King &amp; Prince</span></p><p><span>友よ - SUPER EIGHT</span></p><p><span>Grandeur - Snow man</span></p><p><span>初心LOVE - なにわ男子</span></p><p><span>Voice - Arashi</span></p><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p>]]></description>
